AGENDA ITEMS AND ACTIONS
MANHATTAN BEACH’S CITY COUNCIL WELCOMES YOU!

CERTIFICATION OF MEETING NOTICE AND AGENDA POSTING

A.. CALL MEETING TO ORDER {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fprq2\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa160\sl252\slmult1\i\f0\fs22 Mayor Lesser called the meeting to order.\cf1\i0\f1\fs24\par
}


B.. PLEDGE TO THE FLAG {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fprq2\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\f0\fs22 The Pledge of Allegiance occurred after Item D. Public Comments.\cf1\i0\f1\fs24\par
}


C.. ROLL CALL {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fprq2\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\f0\fs22 Roll Call led by Communications and Civic Engagement Manager Alexandria Latragna.\cf1\i0\f1\fs24\par
}


D.. PUBLIC COMMENTS (2 MINUTES PER PERSON) {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fprq2\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa160\sl252\slmult1\i\f0\fs22 Mayor Lesser opened the floor to public comments.\line\line Seeing no requests to speak, Mayor Lesser closed the floor to public comments.\line\line\pard At 5:01 PM, the City Council recessed and reconvened with all City Councilmembers present.\cf1\i0\f1\fs24\par
}


E.. STATE OF THE CITY {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fprq2\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa160\sl252\slmult1\i\f0\fs22 Mayor Lesser introduced Manhattan Beach Chamber of Commerce Chair, Jessica Vincent, who provided remarks for the 2026 State of the City and introduced John Thorrington, LAFC Co-President, General Manager and former professional soccer player, who presented Master of Ceremony.\line\line LAFC Co-President, General Manager and former professional soccer player Thorrington introduced Mayor David Lesser, who presented the \ldblquote 2026 View for the City.\rdblquote\line\line Mayor Lesser introduced Police Chief Rachel Johnson, who presented the \ldblquote State of MBPD.\rdblquote\line\line Police Chief Johnson introduced City Manager Talyn Mirzakhanian, who presented \ldblquote Moving Business Forward in Manhattan Beach.\rdblquote\line\line City Manager Mirzakhanian introduced Manhattan Beach Chamber of Commerce President and CEO Jill Lamkin, who presented \ldblquote How to Capitalize on the World Cup in Manhattan Beach.\rdblquote\line\line Manhattan Beach Chamber of Commerce President and CEO Lamkin introduced Alexi Lalas, FOX Sports World Cup commentator and former Team USA soccer player, who presented \ldblquote World Cup Visitors: What to Expect.\rdblquote\line\line Manhattan Beach Chamber of Commerce President and CEO Lamkin introduced Manhattan Beach Unified School District Board President Tina Shivpuri, who presented \ldblquote Future of Public Education.\rdblquote\line\line Manhattan Beach Unified School District Board President Shivpuri introduced Manhattan Beach Education Foundation Executive Director Hilary Mahan, who presented \ldblquote Public Education Funding.\rdblquote\line\line Manhattan Beach Chamber of Commerce President Lamkin provided closing remarks for the 2026 State of the City.\line\line Mayor Lesser recognized and introduced the Western State League Champion Red Bananas AYSO U14 Girls Soccer Team.\cf1\i0\f1\fs24\par
}


F.. ADJOURNMENT {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fswiss\fprq2\fcharset0 Arial;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\f0\fs22 At 7:03 PM, Mayor Lesser adjourned the meeting to the May 5, 2026, Adjourned Regular City Council Meeting at 5:00 PM.\cf1\i0\f1\fs24\par
}


